{"item":{"key":"moment:956810","id":"956810","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1609084800000,"text":"太，太熟练了…//[at uid=419474]@棉花街[/at]：但是我觉得如果你想快速把牌子挂起来还是挺容易的[emot=acfun,1689/]早上起床到了地方打开电脑，8点可以挂上[at uid=17912421]@茗魂[/at] [at uid=40656720]@✟艾米莉Emily✟[/at] ，有时候同时间会刷新出[at uid=40909488]@赤三本[/at] 或者是[at uid=36115445]@钱钱酱okane[/at] ，然后磨磨唧唧到了十一点就开始挂[at uid=31541670]@挽什么挽[/at] 和等随机刷出来[at uid=39854908]@苍黛[/at] 。到了中午一点或者晚一点有时候会刷出来[at uid=34195163]@晴心Haruko[/at] [emot=acfun,1689/]再莫急一下到了五点七点可以刷新出来[at uid=179922]@1001Project[/at] ，整七点有[at uid=26090924]@留清月[/at] 到了八点就有[at uid=13722552]@桃夜朔Saku[/at] 和[at uid=34743261]@钱二两_official[/at] ，然后时间推后一点到了绛国八点跟北京时间九点可以等[at uid=20680343]@绛紫长酱紫的绛紫[/at] ，到了九点整可以等着[at uid=32448048]@晴韵Official[/at] ，到了九点到十点之间可以开始等[at uid=11637427]@咪嗷[/at] ，十点整等一下[at uid=2869300]@唐茶[/at] [emot=acfun,1684/]后面如果十二点以后睡不着可以等一下[at uid=41531703]@阎兔_Channel[/at] 随机刷新，日常这些播的比较勤快的。这也是我牌子红的快的秘诀。//[at uid=980114]@你说我大不大[/at]：我感觉氪金最重要[emot=acfun,1701/]","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":8,"likeCount":34,"bananaCount":36,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/956810","timePrecision":"day","source":{"deleted":true},"commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":4,"archivedRoots":3,"threads":{"368001529":{"pages":["comments/956810/threads/368001529/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"368001529","root":"368001529","user":{"id":"20680343","name":"绛紫长酱紫的绛紫","avatar":"98c8ff69551b5654017c733f"},"text":"就离谱w","time":1609165211485,"floor":5,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}}},"commentPages":["comments/956810/all/1.json"],"hotPages":[],"hotCount":0},"media":{"98c8ff69551b5654017c733f":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/content/2020_12_28/1609085329645.JPG?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/z